{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30010_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33c3c9ba3f1692deb0f38c03a7dc7ac6657ae5140470697f0b0ba0f6fbe391e1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feedd8022c5f359d58485844d4c823e47489a33e320bad15bcd66dd86b91d735",
      "text": "他以前也曾负责过为商品制作宣传POP的工作。\n请务必给他一个发挥才能的机会！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03340c6a676abb476b629db4abfb9df6c60bef94efb25ce8063a275602c5982c",
      "text": "（……呵呵。我待过的小杂货店和老牌钟表店相比，\n卖的东西差距也太大了吧。……不过）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a75234300cc42b9d48073febd8cccdda6c8cbbccf12aaf0b0f3872cea11e5ac",
      "text": "（既然被这么信任……\n也没有主动把工作往外推的道理呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:075471d4571f0ae0a4eace98e46427cc9aad38efea6b1092c60b501e0410f823",
      "text": "我明白了。\n不嫌弃我的话，我很乐意提供协助～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37ec8f2984217312427c1aa57afb63ac80d46e723b9ec167137940b899f0209c",
      "text": "接着呢，就聊到了克里斯先生拥有的手表\n防水性能特别出众的话题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f487318189ff9f88dc9ac337bf8728097fde06247d41ff8602619223402d79ec",
      "text": "像什么10个大气压和30个大气压防水的区别之类的，\n聊专业话题也聊得好尽兴呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3108689cf969e8878ae687464517a4281dc32a47141f294ed06750d976404a6b",
      "text": "能听到这么多珍贵的知识，\n真是度过了一段极为充实的时光……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c84cd4c0ea02d310f1b64a76af2111b9ddd3400dbadafcb8ba9084bc96258cf1",
      "text": "后来在那里的交谈，也顺利促成了新的工作。\n雨彦先生，请过目这份资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eafc1c65449a985079de162f537208e79bff594a63a7879ea9dab1c9003b4d6",
      "text": "追加了新的广告……？\n嚯，用上了北村提出的建议啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a57404699f99c4df3cde4a12b82854f678d2e645c86c13acfba6681fd604991",
      "text": "是的！为了能将想乐的创意完美展现出来，\n拍摄当天我们必须加倍努力了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12aebf7f1665f55ba5c57967b5bb2c03058d9030ca3c851a52b932e2b6bac120",
      "text": "哈哈，说的也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c4c65897e5cf57a2a784649bf75703a57e12c87ff06b8daf140bced87662d6",
      "text": "既然对方是老爹的熟人，\n我也得比平时更加打起精神才行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
